# Build context for `docker build` / `podman build` (Podman reads this file too).
# The hub image needs only the workspace manifests, rust-toolchain.toml, Cargo.lock and the
# crate sources; keep everything else out of the context (target/ alone can be tens of GB).
target
node_modules
.git
.superpowers
.impeccable
.env*
ui/dist
src-tauri/gen
*.fernjo
